  "id": "note-1789513105192-lvrbwzz",
  "title": "Clase 14/09 (Importado)",
  "content": "<h2><br></h2><p>Principios SOLID.</p><p>S-&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Single Reponsability : Una clase debe tener una unica responsabilidad.</span></p><p>O-Open/Closed Principle:&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Las entidades de software deben estar abiertas para su extensión, pero cerradas para su modificación</span><span data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">.</span></p><p>L-Liskov Substitution Principle:&nbsp;Los objetos de una clase derivada deben poder reemplazar a los objetos de la clase base sin alterar el funcionamiento correcto del programa</p><p>I-Interface Segregation Principle:&nbsp;Es mejor tener interfaces específicas para cada cliente que una única interfaz general que obligue a implementar métodos que no se utilizan.</p><p>D-Dependency Inversion Principle:&nbsp;<span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"PU8T8_6f\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"yADgie\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Los módulos de alto nivel no deben depender de los de bajo nivel; ambos deben depender de abstracciones.</span></span></p><p><font face=\"Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif, Noto Color Emoji\">Primer principio:</font></p><p><font face=\"Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif, Noto Color Emoji\">Definimos responsabilidad como una razón de cambio, si se piensa que existe más de una razón de cambio, la clase posee más responsabilidad de la que deberia.</font></p><p><font face=\"Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif, Noto Color Emoji\">La estructura de una clase depende de su funcionalidad.</font></p><p><font face=\"Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif, Noto Color Emoji\">----</font></p><p><font face=\"Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif, Noto Color Emoji\">Algunas definiciones (Basicamente haciendo las cosas bien nos evitamos recompilar, y lo mismo sobre tener que modificar la persistencia)</font></p><p><font face=\"Google Sans, Arial, sans-serif, Noto Color Emoji\">Persistir: Trasladar un objeto a memoria (Base de datos) para que no se pierda y permanezca en el sistema.</font></p><p><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"PU8T8_6f\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"yADgie\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Recompilar: Modificar el programa parando la producción.</span></span></p><p><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"PU8T8_6f\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"yADgie\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">----</span></span></p><p><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"PU8T8_6f\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"yADgie\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Segundo principio:</span></span></p><p><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"PU8T8_6f\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"yADgie\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Todos los sitemas cambian durante su ciclo de vida. Debemos considerar esto para hacer los Sistemas lo más dudaderos posibles</span></span></p><p><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"PU8T8_6f\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"yADgie\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Por lo que necesitamos:</span></span></p><p><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"PU8T8_6f\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"yADgie\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">*Todas las variables deberan ser privadas.</span></span></p><p><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"PU8T8_6f\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"yADgie\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">*Deben evitarse variables globales.</span></span></p><p><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"PU8T8_6f\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"yADgie\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">*No hacer uso de identificadores de tipos(Utilizar polimorfismo, no chequear TIPOS - TIPO == TIPO).</span></span></p><p><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"PU8T8_6f\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"yADgie\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Clases,lases,funciones,etc. Deben ser:</span></span></p><p><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"PU8T8_6f\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"yADgie\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">*Abiertas para ser extendidas : El comportamiento debe extenderse(Nuevas funcionalidades, no afectan lo hecho anteriormente)</span></span></p><p><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"PU8T8_6f\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"yADgie\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">*Cerradas para la modificación: El codigo hecho es inviolable, no se debe alterar.</span></span></p><p><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"PU8T8_6f\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"yADgie\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">--------</span></span></p><p><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" jsuid=\"PU8T8_6f\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"yADgie\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Siemp</span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 1rem;\">re buscar abstracciones.</span></p><p>Lo que le da esencia a un obj/clase es su comportamiento/lo que hace.</p><p>--------</p><p>Tercer principio:</p><p>Los subtipos deben poder reemplazar a sus tipos sin alterar el correcto funcionamiento del programa.</p><p>Ej: Herencia - Clase padre - Clase hija.</p><p>Definición TIPO: Protocolo + Semantica</p><p>Definición SUBTIPO: Comparte Protocolo + Semantica del TIPO y además agregas comportamiento nuevo.</p><p>------</p><p>Sobre el cuarto y quinto principio no llegue a copiar, fueron los ultimos 10 minutos de clases y paso volando xD</p><p>-----</p><p>Tip 1. para declarar una interfaz - Ponerse del lado del usuario.</p><p>Tip 2. No tener interfacez extensas.</p>",
